module.events.text:
**Consent to give data to the AI Qadam events bot**

I give [OPERATOR: name, TIN/PINFL, address] my consent to give the AI Qadam events bot the following data from my AI Qadam ID profile:

- Telegram ID;
- Telegram first name, last name and username;
- first and last name from the profile;
- position;
- company;
- city;
- the date the profile was completed.

**Why:** to register me for AI Qadam events, issue a ticket, mark attendance, send me messages about events I am registered for, and receive my feedback and quiz answers.

**What the bot keeps itself:** my registrations, tickets and attendance marks; feedback; quiz answers (with my Telegram name at the time of the answer); mailing delivery records; unfinished steps of a dialogue with the bot; a mark that I have blocked the bot.

The bot does not receive the phone number. The bot gets other fields only with my new consent.

**Term:** until I withdraw this consent or delete the account.

**Withdrawal:** at any time in the settings. After withdrawal the bot deletes everything it keeps about me and stops receiving my data; I will not be able to register for events through the bot. The AI Qadam ID profile stays.

